    "editorialDecision": "Two early wand points deliberately delay Shadowform to 42 and avoid respec. Spirit Tap supports solo/mixed kills; Vampiric Embrace and later Shadowform form the sustained caster route. Shadowform is a damage role, not a healer plan.",
